    {
      "name": "2. Play",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Device-Id",
            "value": "{{deviceId}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/play",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "play"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Call when the streamer presses PLAY / START. No body.\n\nHeaders:\n- Authorization: Bearer <token from Login>\n- X-Device-Id: <the SAME deviceId sent in Login>\n\nok: true -> start the game.\nAny 401 (NO_TOKEN, TOKEN_EXPIRED, TOKEN_INVALID, DEVICE_MISMATCH, SESSION_ENDED) -> go back to the login screen (call Login again).\n403 BANNED -> show \"account banned\" (+ reason).\n\nThe token ends when: a NEWER login happens (only the newest token works), it expires (24h), or the admin bans / changes password / resets the device / deletes the account."
      },
